  note = {Verified: author-hosted text opened 16 November 2026. A.105 uses the Galois norm-index isomorphism in Remark 4.3.7, equation (4.3.1), and the Galois case of Theorem 4.1.7, followed by its own explicit S3 index-two and scalar-cube argument. Theorem 4.1.2 and Example 4.1.4 were also verified in the author-hosted text for the local cyclotomic reciprocity action u to u inverse, used by A.127. The non-Galois reduction in Remark 4.3.8 is not used: in the example at hand the cubic field has no nontrivial abelian subfield over the base, whereas its S3 closure has a quadratic abelian subfield.}
